    <string name="about_text">The service writes the current weather into the iGO profile (save/profiles/01/userlists/weather.txt) so that a compatible skin can show it.\n\nIf the skin publishes the route destination in coordinates_fin.txt, the weather at the destination is written to weather_fin.txt.\n\n1. In the settings, choose the iGO folder (the one that contains \"save\").\n2. Optionally choose the navigator package to launch it together with the service.\n3. Press \"Start service\".\n\nWeather data: Open-Meteo.com, CC BY 4.0.</string>

